  "description": "Pinned ImportPipeline results for one hatto-card apkg on Desktop and Mobile. Both apps build these decks with HATTO_CARD_BIN and compare outcome, ImportPlanCounts, the note_map guid set, and the deck_map deck-name set. Mods and timestamps are not pinned. A note guid is local_note_guid(op_id, k), which is uuid5(op_id, \"note:{k}\"). Deck names use Anki's :: separator. Reconcile maps the empty stock deck Default before the package decks are adopted, so Default is part of every deck-name set. The reimport scenario exports v2 at least two unix seconds after v1, because an equal mod and a different content hash is LOCAL_NEWER.",
